   "title": "1. Executive Summary & Model Overview",
   "goal": "Provide senior management, MRM validators, and auditors a crisp 1-page synthesis of what the model covers, how ECL is calculated, and key limitations.\nEnsure reported Exposure at Default (EAD) balances reconcile to the General Ledger (GL) as of the development reference date.",
   "rep": false,
   "blocks": [
