     "t": "h",
     "text": "1.1 Purpose & Scope"
    },
    {
     "t": "para",
     "label": "",
     "c": {
      "v": "This Model Development Document (MDD) details the theoretical framework, data architecture, empirical estimation, forward-looking macroeconomic integration, and validation results for the [Model Name] ([Model ID]). The model estimates Expected Credit Losses (ECL) in compliance with [IFRS 9 / Ind AS 109 / RBI ECL Directions / ASC 326] for financial instruments measured at Amortized Cost (AC) and Fair Value Through Other Comprehensive Income (FVOCI).",
      "f": 1
     }
    },
